      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Mikey was the Valencruz boys' dog. When he fell gravely ill, their father had him 'fixed' in the Silk Court (Laziel's experiments) and he came back emotionless and obedient. Nyx renamed him <strong>Morrow</strong>. Mikey is the dog; Transformation: Morrow turns him into the Morrow actor (Large, CR 3, spiked). Hired escort Jack keeps him on a spiked leash.</p><p><strong>Balance note (CR 1):</strong> HP 32, AC 13 as on the live sheet (below the DMG CR 1 HP band 71-85 on purpose: a pet, not a boss).</p>",
